\fs28 \cf4 mojo-libc
\fs32  is a library that provides access to the C standard library functions in Mojo.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa530\partightenfactor0

\fs64 \cf0 Getting Started\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf4 The only dependency for 
\fs28 libc
\fs32  is Mojo.\
You can install Mojo following the instructions from the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.modular.com/max/mojo"}}{\fldrslt \cf7 \ul \ulc7 Modular website}}.\
Once you have created a Mojo project using the 
\fs28 magic
\fs32  tool,\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa480\partightenfactor0

\fs48 \cf0 If you are using the magic CLI\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf4 Install the 
\fs28 libc
\fs32  library by running the following command:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf4 \cb5 magic add libc\cf8 \
      \cb1 \
\cb5 \
      \
    \cf0 \
